Merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14342917" author="pkonstantinov" created="Mon, 2 Mar 2015 08:37:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We need to make two more fixes in visor console:&lt;br/&gt;
1. &amp;lt;default&amp;gt; - for cache name = null&lt;br/&gt;
2. &amp;lt;n/a&amp;gt; - for off-heap size (currently printed out -1)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
