-1 value for off-heap size shows how &quot;&amp;lt;n/a&amp;gt;&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14344728" author="kuaw26" created="Tue, 3 Mar 2015 08:32:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please retest escaping for &quot;null&quot; names of grid and caches in sprint-2 branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14346294" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 4 Mar 2015 03:01:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Currently visorcmd shows incorrect value &apos;0&apos; for &apos;off-heap cache size&apos; - should be &apos;UNLIMITED&apos; instead &apos;0&apos; like in GUI Visor&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14346332" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 4 Mar 2015 03:44:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented formatting for 0 value of off-heap size configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
